  "scope": "Research-only generation from the existing belief imputation, public observations and game-source learnsets. Three revealed moves and one surviving monster per side are required. Add safe level/machine/tutor moves and an empty fourth slot; return no model expansion if it would drop the inherited filler. Gen1 sources require all retained moves to be learnable through regular Gen2 sources after transfer. Compatibility of arbitrary egg/event additions is not assumed. Stats, items and all other template fields come from one standard belief determinization at seed zero, with the existing hidden-counter contract; this does not cover the full legal information set. In the certified example, every generated battle matches a separately replayed reference under the unobservable Quick Claw key, for all 40 actual templates. A fresh empty-slot lower certificate extends the existing 39-world ceiling. Only opening choices are scored; subsequent replanning and match strength are not certified. Merged arms use the existing sleep equivalence rule only for adversary root draws; full engine states, logs and chance traces are checked pairwise over complete chance trees. Native 500ms includes model generation and search setup. Dex, pool and learnset loading, validation and certificate computation are outside the clock. Seeds differ from the earlier 39-world experiment; its 16/16 rate is not a matched comparison. No human calibration, production change or iPad timing claim."
